[{"label":"Readable by design","html":"<article class=\"paper\" aria-labelledby=\"pt-title\">\n  <header class=\"paper-hero\">\n    <p class=\"paper-venue\"\n      ><span class=\"badge\" data-variant=\"secondary\">Short paper</span\n      ><span>defuss-shadcn · <time datetime=\"2026-10\">October 2026</time></span></p\n    >\n    <h1 class=\"paper-title\" id=\"pt-title\"\n      >Readable by Design<span class=\"paper-title-sub\">Contrast tiers for themes an agent writes</span></h1\n    >\n    <ul class=\"paper-authors\"\n      ><li>Aron Homberg</li\n      ><li>Claude</li></ul\n    >\n    <div class=\"paper-links\">\n      <div class=\"theme-switcher\" data-theme-base=\"../theme\">\n        <button\n          class=\"btn theme-switcher-trigger\"\n          id=\"pt-ts-trigger\"\n          popovertarget=\"pt-ts-menu\"\n          aria-expanded=\"false\"\n          aria-haspopup=\"menu\"\n        >\n          <span class=\"theme-switcher-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n          <span class=\"theme-switcher-label\">Default</span>\n          <svg\n            class=\"theme-switcher-chevron\"\n            viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"\n            fill=\"none\"\n            stroke=\"currentColor\"\n            stroke-width=\"2\"\n            stroke-linecap=\"round\"\n            stroke-linejoin=\"round\"\n            aria-hidden=\"true\"\n          >\n            <path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\" />\n          </svg>\n        </button>\n        <div id=\"pt-ts-menu\" class=\"theme-switcher-menu\" popover=\"auto\" role=\"menu\" aria-labelledby=\"pt-ts-trigger\">\n          <button\n            class=\"theme-switcher-item\"\n            role=\"menuitemradio\"\n            aria-checked=\"true\"\n            data-theme-id=\"default\"\n            data-theme-label=\"Default\"\n          >\n            <span class=\"theme-switcher-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"theme-switcher-name\">Default</span>\n            <svg\n              class=\"theme-switcher-check\"\n              viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"\n              fill=\"none\"\n              stroke=\"currentColor\"\n              stroke-width=\"2\"\n              stroke-linecap=\"round\"\n              stroke-linejoin=\"round\"\n              aria-hidden=\"true\"\n            >\n              <path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\" />\n            </svg>\n          </button>\n          <button\n            class=\"theme-switcher-item\"\n            role=\"menuitemradio\"\n            aria-checked=\"false\"\n            data-theme-id=\"claude\"\n            data-theme-label=\"Claude\"\n            data-theme-colors=\"#c96442,#e9e6dc,#e9e6dc,#141413,#ede9de\"\n          >\n            <span class=\"theme-switcher-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"theme-switcher-name\">Claude</span>\n            <svg\n              class=\"theme-switcher-check\"\n              viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"\n              fill=\"none\"\n              stroke=\"currentColor\"\n              stroke-width=\"2\"\n              stroke-linecap=\"round\"\n              stroke-linejoin=\"round\"\n              aria-hidden=\"true\"\n            >\n              <path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\" />\n            </svg>\n          </button>\n          <button\n            class=\"theme-switcher-item\"\n            role=\"menuitemradio\"\n            aria-checked=\"false\"\n            data-theme-id=\"catppuccin\"\n            data-theme-label=\"Catppuccin\"\n            data-theme-colors=\"#f5c2e7,#cba6f7,#1e1e2e,#cdd6f4,#313244\"\n          >\n            <span class=\"theme-switcher-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span\n            ><span class=\"theme-switcher-name\">Catppuccin</span>\n            <svg\n              class=\"theme-switcher-check\"\n              viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"\n              fill=\"none\"\n              stroke=\"currentColor\"\n              stroke-width=\"2\"\n              stroke-linecap=\"round\"\n              stroke-linejoin=\"round\"\n              aria-hidden=\"true\"\n            >\n              <path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\" />\n            </svg>\n          </button>\n          <button\n            class=\"theme-switcher-item\"\n            role=\"menuitemradio\"\n            aria-checked=\"false\"\n            data-theme-id=\"cyberpunk\"\n            data-theme-label=\"Cyberpunk\"\n            data-theme-colors=\"#fcee0a,#ff006e,#0a0a12,#e0e0e0,#16161f\"\n          >\n            <span class=\"theme-switcher-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span\n            ><span class=\"theme-switcher-name\">Cyberpunk</span>\n            <svg\n              class=\"theme-switcher-check\"\n              viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"\n              fill=\"none\"\n              stroke=\"currentColor\"\n              stroke-width=\"2\"\n              stroke-linecap=\"round\"\n              stroke-linejoin=\"round\"\n              aria-hidden=\"true\"\n            >\n              <path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\" />\n            </svg>\n          </button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <section class=\"paper-abstract\" aria-labelledby=\"pt-abstract\">\n    <h2 id=\"pt-abstract\">Abstract</h2>\n    <p\n      >A theme is a value for every token and nothing else - but a theme can still be unreadable. We measured the text\n      pairs of the 43 presets that ship with defuss-shadcn and the default palette, 90 palettes in light and dark. Body\n      text reaches 4.5:1 in every one of them; the labels on controls do not. From that measurement we derive three\n      tiers for an automatic theme checker: body text must reach 4.5:1, control labels should and must reach 3:1, and\n      the focus ring should reach 3:1 against the page.</p\n    >\n  </section>\n\n  <nav class=\"paper-toc\" aria-labelledby=\"pt-toc\">\n    <h2 id=\"pt-toc\">Contents</h2>\n    <ol>\n      <li\n        ><a href=\"#pt-s1\"><span class=\"paper-num\">1&nbsp;</span>Measurement</a></li\n      >\n      <li\n        ><a href=\"#pt-s2\"><span class=\"paper-num\">2&nbsp;</span>Tiers</a></li\n      >\n      <li\n        ><a href=\"#pt-cite\"><span class=\"paper-num\">·&nbsp;</span>Citation and references</a></li\n      >\n    </ol>\n  </nav>\n\n  <section class=\"paper-section typeset\" lang=\"en\" data-leading=\"loose\" aria-labelledby=\"pt-s1\">\n    <h2 id=\"pt-s1\"><span class=\"paper-num\">1&nbsp;</span>Measurement</h2>\n    <p\n      >For each palette we computed the WCAG 2 contrast ratio of a foreground token on its surface. The table counts the\n      palettes in which a pair falls below 4.5:1 and below 3:1.</p\n    >\n    <figure class=\"paper-table\">\n      <table class=\"table\">\n        <thead\n          ><tr\n            ><th scope=\"col\">Pair</th><th scope=\"col\" data-num>below 4.5:1</th\n            ><th scope=\"col\" data-num>below 3:1</th></tr\n          ></thead\n        >\n        <tbody>\n          <tr data-best\n            ><td>foreground on background (and card, popover, sidebar)</td><td data-num>0</td><td data-num>0</td></tr\n          >\n          <tr><td>muted-foreground on background</td><td data-num>12</td><td data-num>0</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>primary-foreground on primary</td><td data-num>33</td><td data-num>8</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>destructive-foreground on destructive</td><td data-num>48</td><td data-num>6</td></tr>\n          <tr><td>ring on background</td><td data-num>46</td><td data-num>17</td></tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n      <figcaption class=\"paper-table-caption\"\n        ><b>Table 1.</b> 90 palettes (43 presets and the default, light and dark).</figcaption\n      >\n    </figure>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"paper-section typeset\" lang=\"en\" data-leading=\"loose\" aria-labelledby=\"pt-s2\">\n    <h2 id=\"pt-s2\"><span class=\"paper-num\">2&nbsp;</span>Tiers</h2>\n    <div class=\"paper-numbers\">\n      <div class=\"statistic\"\n        ><p class=\"statistic-title\">Reading</p><p class=\"statistic-value\">4.5:1</p\n        ><p class=\"statistic-description\">an error below</p></div\n      >\n      <div class=\"statistic\"\n        ><p class=\"statistic-title\">Control labels</p><p class=\"statistic-value\">3:1</p\n        ><p class=\"statistic-description\">an error below; 4.5:1 the goal</p></div\n      >\n      <div class=\"statistic\"\n        ><p class=\"statistic-title\">Focus ring</p><p class=\"statistic-value\">3:1</p\n        ><p class=\"statistic-description\">a warning below</p></div\n      >\n    </div>\n    <p\n      >Choose another theme above: the table, the statistics and this text keep their structure; only the token values\n      change. That is the whole contract of a theme.</p\n    >\n  </section>\n  <section class=\"paper-bibtex\" aria-labelledby=\"pt-cite\">\n    <h2 id=\"pt-cite\">Citation and references</h2>\n    <figure class=\"bibtex\" data-formats=\"bibtex apa mla ieee\" aria-label=\"Cite this paper\">\n      <figcaption>Cite this paper</figcaption>\n      <pre><code class=\"bibtex-source\">@techreport{homberg2026themes,\n  title = {Readable by Design: Contrast Tiers for Themes an Agent Writes},\n  author = {Homberg, Aron and Claude},\n  institution = {defuss},\n  year = {2026},\n  month = oct,\n  url = {https://shadcn.defuss.org/papers/paper-themes.html}\n}</code></pre>\n    </figure>\n    <figure class=\"bibtex\" data-formats=\"ieee apa bibtex\" data-format=\"ieee\" aria-label=\"References\">\n      <figcaption>References</figcaption>\n      <pre><code class=\"bibtex-source\">@misc{w3c2023wcag22,\n  author = {{W3C}},\n  title = {Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.2},\n  year = {2023},\n  howpublished = {W3C Recommendation},\n  url = {https://www.w3.org/TR/WCAG22/}\n}\n\n@misc{shadcn2023ui,\n  author = {shadcn},\n  title = {shadcn/ui},\n  year = {2023},\n  url = {https://ui.shadcn.com}\n}\n\n@misc{homberg2026defussshadcn,\n  author = {Homberg, Aron},\n  title = {defuss-shadcn: shadcn-style components as semantic HTML},\n  year = {2026},\n  howpublished = {GitHub},\n  url = {https://github.com/kyr0/defuss-shadcn}\n}</code></pre>\n    </figure>\n  </section>\n</article>\n","individual":false}]
